r": "#432", "widgets_values": ["如果觉得没必要三次放大，也可以把第三次的节点忽略掉"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [4663.79150390625, 2247.101318359375], "id": 285, "properties": {}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["模型选择·：\n3b更加柔和，7b会增加更多细节，但也会保留更多噪点。\nsharp模型会锐化边缘，非二次元画风不要使用，二次元画风谨慎使用。\n\nblocks_to_swap：\n表示有多少个分块在推理过程中动态交换。更高数值会节省更多显存，但推理速度更慢。3b模型范围是1–32，7b模型范围是1–36。\n\noffload_device：\n开启后会把部分模型或者模块放到内存，可以节约显存，但是会降低推理速度。\n\nencode_tile_size：\n编码分块大小，推理时每一块区域的像素大小，数值越小越省显存，但越慢，并且太小会出现接缝问题。\n\nencode_tile_overlap：\n编码分块之间的重叠区域像素大小。增大数值会降低推理速度，增加显存占用，但是重叠越大，越不容易出现接缝。\n\ndecode_tile_size：\n解码分块大小。逻辑和encode tile size类似。\n\ndecode_tile_overlap：\n解码分块之间的重叠区域像素大小。逻辑和encode_tile_overlap类似。\n\n！！！其他参数一般用不到，不要乱调！！！\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [297.2213439941406, 533.487548828125], "pos": [4597.0703125, 2423.148193359375], "id": 276, "properties": {}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "value", "links": [], "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "color": "#1b4669", "widgets_values": [4096], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "INTConstant", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#29699c", "size": [249.75486755371094, 79.24520874023438], "pos": [3851.76806640625, 2822.276611328125], "id": 278, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-kjnodes", "ver": "4dfb85dcc52e4315c33170d97bb987baa46d128b", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "INTConstant"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["一次放大分辨率（最短边）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [4108.77783203125, 2430.640869140625], "id": 273, "properties": {}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": 